# Restaurant order ticket actions

## Invariant

`.rst-order__actions` (non-waiter) must stay **one column, full-width stack**:

```css
.rst-order__actions {
  grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr);
}
```

Do **not** bring back `repeat(2/3, …)` or `grid-column: 1 / -1` on `--bill` for the default footer — that made «Скидка»/«Отменить» half-width and «Выставить счёт» full-width in the narrow ticket column.

## Exception

`.rst-order__footer--waiter .rst-order__actions` may stay compact `auto-fit` side-by-side.
